NAME: ADD with an immediate A takes .AB
DESCRIPTION: (ADD 1 1) adds 1 to its own B-number only, as pMARS does for ADD #1, #1 written by hand; i-7d2612-96f7b1, see behtests/add_default_modifier.beh
SRC:
(seq
  (ADD 1 1)
  (JMP 0))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  ADD.AB #1     , #1     
  JMP    #0     , #0     
  DAT    #0     , #0     